Cooperative Agreement between the Wyoming Department of Transportation and the City
of Cheyenne for West Lincolnway Enhancements between Westland Road and Interstate 80 (2007-
2010 1% Sales Tax, SLIB Funding, and ARRA Funding) -- referred to Finance Committee.  Mr.
Collins advised the item was discussed under other items for the agenda at the most recent Finance
Committee meeting and that provisions of Title 2 of City Code had been met.  Mr. Collins moved
to approve, seconded by Ms. Broyles.  Mr. Collins moved to amend by substitute Exhibit B,
seconded by Ms. Broyles. Tom Mason, Cheyenne MPO Director, explained the estimated cost for
the project was initially $1.7 million with WYDOT agreeing to contribute $1 million toward the
median enhancements portion of the project, noting additional economic stimulus funds have been
received.  He advised WYDOT recently opened bids with the lowest bid received being less than
```

### Page 6 of 8

```text
anticipated ($973,000.00) and that the proposed substitute (Exhibit B) changes the dollar amount
from $1 million to $973,000.00 (city’s share estimated at $16,574.00).  He stated there will be
some additional costs to the city (connections, construction management oversight, etc.) as the
project progresses. Upon inquiry regarding adding landscaping to the north and south side of the
corridor, Mr. Mason advised it may be possible to implement at some point and could involve
WYDOT approval through a change order.  He explained the median’s design will have lighting
and watering systems in the median and those systems could probably be tapped into in the future
for watering landscaping that may be installed on the north/south side of the road.  Comments
followed on providing infrastructure, in conjunction with the project, for an irrigation/watering
system for future landscaping on the north/south roadway areas to alleviate additional work
involving reconstruction.  Motion to amend by substitute carried.  Voting “yes” –  all members of
the governing body present.  Main motion as amended by substitute carried.  Voting “yes” – all
members of the governing body present.  (#5381)
