ANNOUNCEMENTS/REPORTS/MOTIONS:
Announcement was made that due to the Memorial Day holiday on Monday, May 25, 2009,
the regular meeting of the Governing Body will be held Tuesday, May 26, 2009 at 6:00 p.m. in
City Council Chambers.
Announcement was made of three calcuttas to be held at the Plains Hotel, Range Room,
1600 Capitol Avenue, Cheyenne, WY on Friday, June 12, 2009 at 11:00 a.m. and 7:00 p.m., and
Saturday, June 13, 2009 at 7:00 p.m. in conjunction with the Cheyenne Depot Museum’s 2009
Peppers On The Plaza, Cheyenne’s Chili Cook-Off Event.  Proceeds to benefit United Way of
```

