Laramie County, Cheyenne Depot Museum and Cheyenne Depot Museum Foundation.
Announcement was made of a calcutta to be held Thursday, June 4, 2009 beginning at 7:00
p.m. at Uncle Charlie’s Lounge, 6001 Yellowstone Road, in conjunction with the annual Uncle
Charlie’s “DONE” golf tournament (15% of proceeds to benefit the Cheyenne Boys and Girls
Club).
Announcement was made of the Re-Appointment of Jeannine Stallings to the Public Transit
Advisory Board; David Evans to the Board of Public Utilities; Janet Cowley to the Cheyenne-
Laramie County Economic Development Joint Powers Board; and Debbie Disney-Caldwell to the
Tourism Promotion Joint Powers Board, to be confirmed May 26, 2009.
OTHER CITY BUSINESS:
John Fafoutakis commented on the opportunity to be heard under other business at City
Council meetings, specifically referencing the April 27, 2009 meeting.
There being no further business to come before the governing body, the meeting was
officially adjourned at 6:44 p.m.
